#: specialactions.cpp:103
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Special Alarm Actions"
msgstr "Besünner Alarmakschonen"

#: specialactions.cpp:161
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Pre-Alarm Action"
msgstr "Akschoon vör Alarm"

#: specialactions.cpp:171 specialactions.cpp:197
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Command:"
msgstr "Befehl:"

#: specialactions.cpp:176
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>Enter a shell command to execute before the alarm is displayed.</"
"para><para>Note that it is executed only when the alarm proper is displayed, "
"not when a reminder or deferred alarm is displayed.</para><para><note>KAlarm "
"will wait for the command to complete before displaying the alarm.</note></"
"para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Hier kannst Du en Konsoolbefehl ingeven, de utföhrt warrt, ehr de "
"Alarmnaricht opdukt.</para><para>De Befehl warrt bloots denn opropen, ehr de "
"Alarm sülven opdukt, man nich wenn en Vöranstoot oder verschaven Alarm wiest "
"warrt.</para><para><note>KAlarm töövt op't Beennen vun den Befehl, ehr dat "
"den Alarmbescheed wiest.</note></para>"

#: specialactions.cpp:182
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Cancel alarm on error"
msgstr "Alarm bi Fehler afseggen"

#: specialactions.cpp:183
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Cancel the alarm if the pre-alarm command fails, i.e. do not display the "
"alarm or execute any post-alarm action command."
msgstr ""
"Den Alarm nich utlösen, wenn de Akschoon vör den Alarm fehlsleit. De Alarm "
"warrt nich wiest un keen Na-Alarm-Akschonen opropen."

#: specialactions.cpp:187
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Post-Alarm Action"
msgstr "Akschoon na Alarm"

#: specialactions.cpp:201
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>Enter a shell command to execute after the alarm window is closed.</"
"para><para>Note that it is not executed after closing a reminder window. If "
"you defer the alarm, it is not executed until the alarm is finally "
"acknowledged or closed.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Hier kannst Du en Konsoolbefehl ingeven, de eerst denn utföhrt warrt, "
"wenn Du den Alarmbescheed tomaakst.</para><para>De Befehl warrt nich "
"opropen, wenn Du en Vöranstoot tomaakst. Verschuffst Du en Alarm, warrt de "
"Befehl nich opropen, ehr Du den Alarm nich afsluuts tomaakst.</para>"

